      bullCase: "The sustained rally of Bitcoin and Ethereum despite regulatory headwinds indicates a strong, fundamental shift towards greater market maturity and investor confidence. The \'Clarity Act mess\' was absorbed without significant downturn, suggesting that market participants are increasingly looking past short-term FUD towards long-term adoption and technological innovation. This resilience could attract further institutional capital, driving a sustained bull run.",
