      bullCase: "Shein\'s proven ability to capture a massive global customer base through its ultra-low-price, rapid-fashion model, combined with its expansive reach across 160 markets and over a billion annual orders, suggests significant untapped growth potential. Its efficient supply chain allows it to quickly adapt to trends, maintaining a competitive edge. The Hong Kong listing provides a stable platform for capital raising and expansion, particularly in Asian markets, enabling further market penetration and technological investments.",
