    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a split composition. On the left, a stylized depiction of a corporate office building (representing Bitcoin Suisse) with some windows dark, suggesting job cuts and restructuring, with a subtle arrow pointing abroad. In the center, a strong, vibrant image of a ballot box or a political podium adorned with a digital currency symbol (like Bitcoin\'s \'B\') and stacks of digital coins, symbolizing the significant political donations to Reform UK. On the right, a conceptual visual showing a balanced scale, with one side weighted by abstract AI-chip-like elements and the other side by a glowing Bitcoin symbol, representing the \'bonds for Bitcoin\' portfolio rebalancing thesis. The overall aesthetic should be clean, professional, and convey motion or change, with a color palette that blends corporate blue, political red, and digital gold/silver.",
