    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a dynamic composition that visually represents the intersection of cryptocurrency, artificial intelligence, and political influence. The central focus should be a stylized digital ledger or blockchain network intertwining with glowing neural network pathways, symbolizing AI. In the background, subtly integrated elements such as a corporate finance chart, a ballot box, and a digital currency symbol should be visible. The overall aesthetic should be professional, sophisticated, and convey a sense of global connectivity and technological advancement. Use a balanced color palette of blues, greens, and subtle golds, with sharp, clean lines and a modern feel. The layout should have distinct sections, resembling a financial news front page, without being overly cluttered.",
