      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "We assign a 50% probability to a \'Neutral\' outlook, where AI growth continues but is tempered by regulatory and competitive challenges. A 30% probability is given to a \'Bullish\' scenario, assuming AI\'s transformative power largely overcomes hurdles. A 20% probability is assigned to a \'Bearish\' scenario, where litigation, inequality, and trade wars significantly impede progress. Overall, the trajectory is positive but with notable headwinds.",
