    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing the Indian financial market\'s complex dynamics. On one side, a stylized graph depicting a downward trend (Nifty), with an arrow pointing downwards, alongside a subtle globe indicating global headwinds. On the other side, a stable, upright line graph (Rupee) with a protective hand (RBI intervention) shielding it from turbulent waves (crude oil prices). In the foreground, a sleek, modern smartphone (Lava Agni 4N) with an Indian flag motif, symbolizing global expansion and innovation, emerging from India towards a blurred UK skyline. Use a clean, professional, and slightly abstract style with a palette of deep blues, golds, and subtle reds, emphasizing resilience and ambition amidst challenges.",
