      ecosystemAnalysis: "Bitcoin anchors the entire cryptocurrency ecosystem, with numerous exchanges, wallets, payment processors, and layer-2 solutions (like the Lightning Network) built around it. Its robust network security and widespread acceptance make it a foundational digital asset.",
