    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a dynamic visual representation of Bitcoin\'s price surge. In the foreground, a stylized digital representation of a Bitcoin coin stands tall, partially obscuring a globe that shows global financial flows. In the background, subtle visual cues of US Treasury buildings and abstract lines representing expanding sanctions or shifting geopolitical power are visible. In the lower corner, a small, subtle icon of a breached digital wallet and a green energy leaf intertwined with a blockchain symbol. The overall aesthetic should be sophisticated and indicative of financial news, with a focus on the interplay between crypto, global finance, security, and politics. Use a color palette of deep blues, golds, and subtle reds, with a clean, professional finish.",
